This package contains original, machine-assisted reformulations of methodologies and decision
frameworks derived from the Russian edition of “Fundamentals of Software Architecture” by Mark
Richards and Neal Ford, ISBN 978-601-12-6107-4. The original English edition is published by
O'Reilly Media and is copyright © 2020 Mark Richards and Neal Ford. All rights in the source book,
its translation, figures, examples, trademarks, and trade dress remain with their respective owners.

The owner recorded the public-distribution decision at CP5 in `sources.json`. The source PDF and
extracted corpus are not included. Before release, a mechanical word-shingling gate compares the
public artifact with the source corpus and rejects uncited verbatim runs of eight or more words.
That gate is evidence of transformation discipline, not a licence or legal opinion.

You may install and use this package, including commercially, and quote short attributed passages
from its original reformulations. You may not resell the package, republish it under another name,
or redistribute a modified copy of the package or its Knowledge Units as your own work.

This package is not affiliated with or endorsed by Mark Richards, Neal Ford, O'Reilly Media, or the
publisher of the Russian edition. It is decision support, not a substitute for the book. No warranty
of any kind is provided.
